# Pipeline output: regenerated by every run on the host, so it isn't kept in Git.
# Each folder keeps a .gitkeep so it still exists in a fresh clone.
TestCases/*
TestDesign/*
TestReview/*
TestResults/*
FailureAnalysis/*
ReleaseReadiness/*
PipelineReports/*
!*/.gitkeep
